flowchart TD
    A[Signer / University Office] --> B[Select Document]
    B --> C[Load RSA Private Key]
    C --> D[Hash and Sign with RSA-PSS + SHA-256]
    D --> E[Document + Signature File]
    F[Verifier] --> G[Upload Document, Signature and Public Key]
    G --> H[Verify RSA-PSS Signature]
    H --> I{Signature valid?}
    I -- No --> J[Reject: INVALID]
    I -- Yes --> K[Optional Trusted-Key Record Check]
    K --> L{Fingerprint matches and status ACTIVE?}
    L -- Yes --> M[Signature VALID + Key TRUSTED]
    L -- No --> N[Signature VALID, Key NOT TRUSTED]
